# Deploy when work is done

When a coding task in this workspace is finished, do not ask. Immediately:

1. Commit the relevant files (never `.env`, API keys, or credentials).
2. Push to GitHub `origin` (`joun90-droid/delivery-review-ai-reply`, branch `main`).
3. Deploy Firebase Hosting: `firebase deploy --only hosting --project vaulted-acolyte-387217` (site `jeonyoungjae-review-ai`).
4. If there is nothing to commit, still deploy if hosting files changed; skip push if already up to date.
5. End the reply with both URLs:

- GitHub: https://github.com/joun90-droid/delivery-review-ai-reply
- Live: https://jeonyoungjae-review-ai.web.app
